# FlowTree — Perfil do usuário autenticado

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Meus dados
GET {{host}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar nome e cargo
PUT {{host}}/me
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Administrador",
  "position": "Gestor de projetos"
}

### Alterar a própria senha
PUT {{host}}/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "current_password": "password",
  "password": "novaSenha123",
  "password_confirmation": "novaSenha123"
}

### Enviar foto de perfil (jpg/png/webp, máx. 5 MB)
POST {{host}}/me/avatar
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FlowTreeBoundary

------FlowTreeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
------FlowTreeBoundary--

### Remover foto de perfil
DELETE {{host}}/me/avatar
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Módulos do sistema
GET {{host}}/modules
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
